  fast-sink limit (reported, not load-bearing): Saha x_e = 0.5 at z = 1369.0 vs CAMB 1275.6; z* -> 1169.7; 100theta_* -> 0.99254, -162 sigma at fixed parameters (illustrative: a modified recombination code and the Planck likelihood are needed)

