         measured: max |difference| 0.0e+00
  G2 class R2b-mono (and its members R2b-const): EXCLUDED.  R2b-leak (drive then leakage): the chains' own CPL shape, whose rho_DE maximum is the w = -1 crossing -> CONSISTENT by construction, NON-DIAGNOSTIC (a restatement of the fit), and it needs a phantom epoch (CFG176/CFG195).
  The committed example of a drive: CFG176's accumulation (a0 ~ t, rho_DE ~ t^2), phantom at every z, excluded at 27-36 sigma (Gaussian proxy).
